  "definition": "Revocation of Licenses",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-03-02",
  "historyNote": "#7315, eff 7-1-00; ss by #9189, INTERIM, eff 7-1-08, EXPIRES: 12-28-08; ss by #9325, eff 11-21-08; ss by #12101, eff 2-3-17; ss by #13175, eff 3-2-21",
